{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/af639020dd720bc89a3fe93977ce288f.poster.avif?t=1771002652\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/af639020dd720bc89a3fe93977ce288f.webm?t=1771002652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/af639020dd720bc89a3fe93977ce288f.mp4?t=1771002652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0e\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Join fellow detectives all over the world in the official digital board game version of Clue/Cluedo! Gather crucial evidence, interrogate suspects and solve the original murder mystery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Miss Scarlett, Colonel Mustard, Professor Plum, Chef White, Solicitor Peacock and Mayor Green through the iconic Tudor Mansion, unlocking their motives and alibis as you go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Clue/Cluedo the way you remember it in Classic Mode, or jump in for a quick game with Clue Cards mode. Alternatively, if you want to really test your sleuthing skills, try a new investigation format available exclusively to Clue/Cluedo \u2013 Ultimate Detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ultimate Detective Mode, everyone answers suggestions at the same time\u2026but secretly! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your suspects in a direct interrogation as you rely on your skills of deduction to get to the truth. Experience the mystery, solve the murder and become a top-tier detective!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW TO PLAY CLUE/CLUEDO:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three cards are dealt face-down and set aside \u2013 this is the solution to the crime!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone is dealt three Clue Cards. These are automatically crossed off your clue sheet, as they can\u2019t be part of the solution. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice and move around the board. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you enter a room, you can make a suggestion \u2013 select who you think the murderer is, what weapon they used and where the crime happened. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other players will then aim to disprove your suggestion; if one of your suggestions matches a card in their hand, they show you that card to disprove it. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your clue sheet to keep track of which characters, weapons and rooms have been disproven. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve figured it out? It\u2019s time to make an accusation! Be careful though \u2013 if you\u2019re right, you win, but if you are wrong, you\u2019re out! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/d4ae9ccbdc110091ba24e3d24591cf85.poster.avif?t=1771002652\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/d4ae9ccbdc110091ba24e3d24591cf85.webm?t=1771002652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/d4ae9ccbdc110091ba24e3d24591cf85.mp4?t=1771002652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the beloved original board game, now rendered in stunning 3D animation and entirely ad-free! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/77a5540bf89548989bf7ff8f2f17f29e.poster.avif?t=1771002652\" width=615 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/77a5540bf89548989bf7ff8f2f17f29e.mp4?t=1771002652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive to the digital version of Clue/Cluedo, Ultimate Detective Mode lets you interrogate multiple characters at once. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/3d3c202b2dd437dc5404caec31bcaab9.poster.avif?t=1771002652\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/3d3c202b2dd437dc5404caec31bcaab9.webm?t=1771002652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/3d3c202b2dd437dc5404caec31bcaab9.mp4?t=1771002652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened after the shocking events of Tudor Mansion? Find out in a series of original new crime scenes designed specifically for the digital version of Clue/Cluedo! New characters emerge, bringing with them new clues, motives and case files to consider as you travel around the world in search of the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/48e56e8540f515ca16f924e1634101b9.avif?t=1771002652\" width=614 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against cutting-edge AI opponents that adapt to your skill level for the perfect game, or challenge detectives around the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/9c164f6134c4413fe5a1bfb6229a25a2.avif?t=1771002652\" width=614 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also play a private online match or local multiplayer with friends and family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your mind with the iconic murder-mystery board game, now available on Steam! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Detective In The Making","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2506480/3a84d2b4339946225f6c78e84ffbf5ea18375db3.jpg"},{"name":"The Plot Thickens...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2506480/adc61ef652f846ca5e4ad06f93bea06a2c6a90c5.jpg"},{"name":"Online Sleuth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2506480/b89e27ebdc00c36470fb45985999369be0b12c78.jpg"},{"name":"A Killer Among Us","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2506480/5610efc14b5e67273e708d5db390b8e5e03ebd0a.jpg"},{"name":"Element of Surprise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2506480/735d37e68550a01044e43432ae18a410d6e909a2.jpg"},{"name":"Deduction Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2506480/38309b38df3c0f5d462dfcb36e5753d2233abfdf.jpg"},{"name":"Nobody Suspects The Inquisitor!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2506480/226d786232b5d2c6bb6aaef5ca4c87dffc93c4b9.jpg"},{"name":"Old School Detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2506480/8c364009f4bc59ac46f1649dbbe5e646d02dbfb4.jpg"},{"name":"Appearances Matter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2506480/988f4d88b960604cbc1906c5af883b8b45e33efa.jpg"},{"name":"A Victorious Token","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2506480/fd1ad65ec0b2887eced79f1e9829060edee725ba.jpg"}],"total":37},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2506480?t=1771002652","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771002652","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/b21508ae6237b1d1b4d9d148d171f4693d8c26b3/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_5.jpg?t=1771002652","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/b21508ae6237b1d1b4d9d148d171f4693d8c26b3/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_5.jpg?t=1771002652","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/af639020dd720bc89a3fe93977ce288f.poster.avif?t=1771002652\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/af639020dd720bc89a3fe93977ce288f.webm?t=1771002652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/af639020dd720bc89a3fe93977ce288f.mp4?t=1771002652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0e\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Join fellow detectives all over the world in the official digital board game version of Clue/Cluedo! Gather crucial evidence, interrogate suspects and solve the original murder mystery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Miss Scarlett, Colonel Mustard, Professor Plum, Chef White, Solicitor Peacock and Mayor Green through the iconic Tudor Mansion, unlocking their motives and alibis as you go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Clue/Cluedo the way you remember it in Classic Mode, or jump in for a quick game with Clue Cards mode. Alternatively, if you want to really test your sleuthing skills, try a new investigation format available exclusively to Clue/Cluedo \u2013 Ultimate Detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ultimate Detective Mode, everyone answers suggestions at the same time\u2026but secretly! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your suspects in a direct interrogation as you rely on your skills of deduction to get to the truth. Experience the mystery, solve the murder and become a top-tier detective!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW TO PLAY CLUE/CLUEDO:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three cards are dealt face-down and set aside \u2013 this is the solution to the crime!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone is dealt three Clue Cards. These are automatically crossed off your clue sheet, as they can\u2019t be part of the solution. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice and move around the board. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you enter a room, you can make a suggestion \u2013 select who you think the murderer is, what weapon they used and where the crime happened. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other players will then aim to disprove your suggestion; if one of your suggestions matches a card in their hand, they show you that card to disprove it. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your clue sheet to keep track of which characters, weapons and rooms have been disproven. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve figured it out? It\u2019s time to make an accusation! Be careful though \u2013 if you\u2019re right, you win, but if you are wrong, you\u2019re out! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/d4ae9ccbdc110091ba24e3d24591cf85.poster.avif?t=1771002652\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/d4ae9ccbdc110091ba24e3d24591cf85.webm?t=1771002652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/d4ae9ccbdc110091ba24e3d24591cf85.mp4?t=1771002652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the beloved original board game, now rendered in stunning 3D animation and entirely ad-free! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/77a5540bf89548989bf7ff8f2f17f29e.poster.avif?t=1771002652\" width=615 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/77a5540bf89548989bf7ff8f2f17f29e.mp4?t=1771002652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive to the digital version of Clue/Cluedo, Ultimate Detective Mode lets you interrogate multiple characters at once. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/3d3c202b2dd437dc5404caec31bcaab9.poster.avif?t=1771002652\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/3d3c202b2dd437dc5404caec31bcaab9.webm?t=1771002652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/3d3c202b2dd437dc5404caec31bcaab9.mp4?t=1771002652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened after the shocking events of Tudor Mansion? Find out in a series of original new crime scenes designed specifically for the digital version of Clue/Cluedo! New characters emerge, bringing with them new clues, motives and case files to consider as you travel around the world in search of the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/48e56e8540f515ca16f924e1634101b9.avif?t=1771002652\" width=614 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against cutting-edge AI opponents that adapt to your skill level for the perfect game, or challenge detectives around the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/9c164f6134c4413fe5a1bfb6229a25a2.avif?t=1771002652\" width=614 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also play a private online match or local multiplayer with friends and family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your mind with the iconic murder-mystery board game, now available on Steam! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Marmalade Game Studio Ltd"],"dlc":[4341730,4194490,3659490,2666740,3465720,3252340,2880150,2556790,2556800],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta